  "regionalNotes": "Gulf, Egyptian and Maghreb sources added 2026-09-24 (the owner, after reading الشرق الأوسط beside Khazendar: their economy file is ~40% Saudi, Gulf and Egyptian). Tried and dropped the same day, with the newsroom's own client: SPA (spa.gov.sa/rss.xml now serves the web app; no feed), WAM (a bot wall answers), KUNA (connection fails), QNA (404), Argaam and Asharq Business (a challenge page, HTTP 202), Al Arabiya, Ahram, Arab News category feeds, IMF and OPEC (HTTP 403), Aleqt, Al Bayan, Gulf News, Zawya, Al Qabas, Times of Oman (no feed found), Amwal Al Ghad (/feed/ serves the home page), Okaz (its RSS page is script-built), CNBC Arabia (no feed found). Khaleej Times' business category and Egypt Independent carry mostly non-business items and were left out.",
  "papersNotes": "Open-access economics research read only by the paper mode (--mode=paper); the news editor never sees these. Verified 2026-09-12. `abstractOnly` marks series whose landing page yields no more than the abstract (the feed carries it; `summaryChars` keeps it whole); `allowPdf` admits a series whose feed links straight to the PDF. Dropped after testing: IMF (HTTP 403 to every client), BIS (the doclist RSS is gone from the redesigned site), CEPR VoxEU (feed fine, column pages sit behind a Cloudflare challenge), AEA JEP, IZA (no RSS) and OECD (HTTP 403).",
